  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ec86cd1f-1922-46cf-beea-713f33fc5fda"],
 ". Since the obstruction is expanded before the test, an action with \
symbolic coefficients returns ",
 Cell[BoxData["False"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "57fc5828-9b41-4811-ae5d-c7d17b012510"],
 " unless the obstruction vanishes identically."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"efc1be55-e5f8-452a-99d5-a16979ea2ad2"]
